  <item>
    <title>郑执：谁能告诉我东北文学是啥啊？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a900b571352af56ff3cf8db</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a900b571352af56ff3cf8db</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 27 Aug 2026 10:09:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期，我们和郑执一起聊他的新书《朱砂掌》，一个男性作家如何书写女性，以及东北文学、东北文艺复兴。</span></p><p><strong><span>【嘉宾】</span></strong></p><p><span>郑执 作家、导演，代表作小说《仙症》、电影《森中有林》</span></p><p><strong><span>【主播】</span></strong></p><p><span>林子人&nbsp;南方周末文化副刊部记者</span></p><p><span>余雅琴&nbsp;南方周末文化副刊部记者</span></p><h3><span>【收听提示】</span></h3><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;郑执的新书《朱砂掌》让人想起日本作家柚木麻子的《黄油》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;我是被家里的女性长辈围绕着长大的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="901">15:01</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;想跨越生理的鸿沟是非常难的事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;我推翻了一开始的视角</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;想起了电影《妙笔生花》：“you take the words,you take the pain.”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2014">33:34</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;我要让你真真切切感到这个文字背后的痛苦，你能不能接得住？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2308">38:28</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;还是因为对后果的大数据积累不足</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2356">39:16</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;拍完电影之后，对小说生出一种曾经没有的留恋和依赖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2621">43:41</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;《生吞》的本质是青春小说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2952">49:12</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;香港给我最大的冲击是反差感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3145">52:25</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;“东北文艺复兴”问我是问错人了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3453">57:33</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;《朱砂掌》里嘲讽了满口热词的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3961">01:06:01</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;虚构也可以看到真实的情感；过分地暴露，也可以看到美化和夸大</span></p><p><strong><span>【出品团队】</span></strong></p><p><span>编辑：黎衡</span></p><p><span>音频剪辑：冯钰炫</span></p><p><span>运营推广：冯钰炫</span></p>]]></description>
